WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
In Forms, place a text box over the answer area.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Add a checkbox beside its printed prompt.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Detect more form fields and review the suggestions.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Continue to review and choose PDF export.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Save the fillable PDF and open it in a reader.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Type into the exported text fields and tick a checkbox.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.400
Check the fields on the remaining pages.
